# Technical Fundamentals - Class Diagram Template

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class BaseClass {
        +id: string
        +createdAt: DateTime
        +update()
        +delete()
    }
    
    class DerivedClass {
        +name: string
        +value: number
        +calculate()
    }
    
    class Interface {
        <<interface>>
        +method1()
        +method2()
    }
    
    BaseClass <|-- DerivedClass
    Interface <|.. DerivedClass
    BaseClass *-- "0..*" Component : contains
```

## Usage
Define your classes, attributes, methods, and relationships.